Trello

 
7 lightweight ways to customize Trello
 
Quick capture, scheduled comments, and more! Trello's super user, Britt Joiner, gives us the download on customizing Trello perfectly.
 
Customize and curate 
>> https://blog.trello.com/lightweight-ways-to-customize-trello?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-july2023-newsletter1_EML-16129&jobid=106137187&subid=1751586021&send_date=7/18/2023


Do more with Trello and Confluence
 
Context switching kills productivity. Here's how Trello and Confluence work together to consolidate those tabs and help you do better work.
 
The perfect combo
>> https://blog.trello.com/trello-and-confluence-the-perfect-teamwork-combo?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-july2023-newsletter1_EML-16129&jobid=106137187&subid=1751586021&send_date=7/18/2023


Turn notes into knowledge with the Zettelkasten Method
 
Master the Zettelkasten Method: a method of note‑taking to help you turn nuggets of information, facts, and findings into lasting knowledge.
 
Take note
>> https://blog.trello.com/zettelkasten-method?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-july2023-newsletter1_EML-16129&jobid=106137187&subid=1751586021&send_date=7/18/2023


Everything you need to know about process improvement 
 
Companies who are still using the same legacy tools, processes, and methods are losing out on employee productivity and efficiency. In this guide, we'll walk through the ins and outs of process improvement and how companies can embrace change.
 
Get the guide
>> https://blog.trello.com/enterprise/why-process-improvement-matters-for-your-team?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-july2023-newsletter1_EML-16129&jobid=106137187&subid=1751586021&send_date=7/18/2023


Customer Story: improving collaboration with Trello
 
Check out this session on how one company used Trello to streamline communication workflow and improve collaboration across their corporate communications team.
 
Watch session
>> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ja866Iws2mo

